WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.188
Today we will use evidence to discuss a performance. Our work connects with our own

00:00:05.188 --> 00:00:05.853
local community.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.239
Watch or listen carefully without interrupting.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.985
Record one strength in timing, expression or teamwork.

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:18.109
Suggest one useful change and say how to rehearse it.
